:33.090">Don't </span><span begin="00:33.090" end="00:33.330">tell </span><span begin="00:33.330" end="00:33.690">me</span><span begin="00:33.690" end="00:34.290">nothing's </span><span begin="00:34.290" end="00:34.470">on </span><span begin="00:34.470" end="00:34.620">your </span><span begin="00:34.620" end="00:35.220">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.220" end="00:37.830"><span begin="00:35.220" end="00:35.340">If </span><span begin="00:35.340" end="00:35.460">we're </span><span begin="00:35.460" end="00:35.940">honest</span><span begin="00:35.940" end="00:36.120">,</span><span begin="00:36.120" end="00:36.300">it </span><span begin="00:36.300" end="00:36.600">will </span><span begin="00:36.600" end="00:36.810">all </span><span begin="00:36.810" end="00:36.960">be </span><span begin="00:36.960" end="00:37.830">fine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.040" end="00:39.600"><span begin="00:38.040" end="00:38.220">I'm </span><span begin="00:38.220" end="00:38.610">someone </span><span begin="00:38.610" end="00:38.700">who </span><span begin="00:38.700" end="00:38.880">likes </span><span begin="00:38.880" end="00:38.940">to </span><span begin="00:38.940" end="00:39.240">talk </span><span begin="00:39.240" end="00:39.600">things</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.320" end="00:42.480"><span begin="00:40.320" end="00:40.410">The </span><span begin="00:40.410" end="00:40.770">hardest </span><span begin="00:40.770" end="00:40.920">thing </span><span begin="00:40.920" end="00:41.040">is </span><span begin="00:41.040" end="00:41.370">getting </span><span begin="00:41.370" end="00:41.550">it </span><span begin="00:41.550" end="00:41.790">out </span><span begin="00:41.790" end="00:41.940">of </span><span begin="00:41.940" end="00:42.480">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.510" end="00:44.580"><span begin="00:42.510" end="00:42.660">I </span><span begin="00:42.660" end="00:42.900">should </span><span begin="00:42.900" end="00:43.110">sit </span><span begin="00:43.110" end="00:43.470">back </span><span begin="00:43.470" end="00:43.680">and </span><span begin="00:43.680" end="00:43.890">give </span><span begin="00:43.890" end="00:44.130">you </span><span begin="00:44.130" end="00:44.250">a </span><span begin="00:44.250" end="00:44.580">break</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.580" end="00:46.320"><span begin="00:44.580" end="00:44.730">Let </span><span begin="00:44.730" end="00:44.820">you </span><span begin="00:44.820" end="00:45.150">close </span><span begin="00:45.150" end="00:45.360">your </span><span begin="00:45.360" end="00:46.110">perfect </span><span begin="00:46.110" end="00:46.320">eyes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.350" end="00:48.810"><span begin="00:46.350" end="00:46.620">'Cause </span><span begin="00:46.620" end="00:46.890">there's </span><span begin="00:46.890" end="00:47.130">no </span><span begin="00:47.130" end="00:47.430">need </span><span begin="00:47.430" end="00:47.850">to </span><span begin="00:47.850" end="00:48.810">explain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.960" end="00:51.330"><span begin="00:48.960" end="00:49.200">I </span><span begin="00:49.200" end="00:49.560">know </span><span begin="00:49.560" end="00:49.890">what </span><span begin="00:49.890" end="00:50.070">you </span><span begin="00:50.070" end="00:50.520">want </span><span begin="00:50.520" end="00:50.580">to </span><span begin="00:50.580" end="00:51.330">say</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.360" end="00:55.950"><span begin="00:51.360" end="00:51.570">We </span><span begin="00:51.570" end="00:51.870">could </span><span begin="00:51.870" end="00:52.050">just </span><span begin="00:52.050" end="00:52.740">say </span><span begin="00:52.740" end="00:53.670">goodnight </span><span begin="00:53.670" end="00:54.000">if </span><span begin="00:54.000" end="00:54.150">you </span><span begin="00:54.150" end="00:54.540">think </span><span begin="00:54.540" end="00:55.080">that's </span><span begin="00:55.080" end="00:55.950">alright</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.010" end="00:58.200"><span begin="00:56.010" end="00:56.340">There's </span><span begin="00:56.340" end="00:56.550">no </span><span begin="00:56.550" end="00:56.850">need </span><span begin="00:56.850" end="00:57.270">to </span><span begin="00:57.270" end="00:58.200">explain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.380" end="01:00.660"><span begin="00:58.380" end="00:58.590">I </span><span begin="00:58.590" end="00:58.950">know </span><span begin="00:58.950" end="00:59.250">that </span><span begin="00:59.250" end="00:59.460">we </span><span begin="00:59.460" end="00:59.940">can </span><span begin="00:59.940" end="01:00.660">relate</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.690" end="01:05.310"><span begin="01:00.690" end="01:01.020">Can </span><span begin="01:01.020" end="01:01.230">we </span><span begin="01:01.230" end="01:02.010">get </span><span begin="01:02.010" end="01:02.340">up </span><span begin="01:02.340" end="01:02.430">and </span><span begin="01:02.430" end="01:02.820">try </span><span begin="01:02.820" end="01:03.000">to </span><span begin="01:03.000" end="01:03.420">feel </span><span begin="01:03.420" end="01:04.380">okay </span><span begin="01:04.380" end="01:05.070">again</span><span begin="01:05.070" end="01:05.310">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.310" end="01:05.820"><span begin="01:05.310" end="01:05.340">O</span><span begin="01:05.340" end="01:05.340">.</span><span begin="01:05.340" end="01:05.820">K</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.990" end="01:20.040"><span begin="01:15.990" end="01:16.560">I'm </span><span begin="01:16.560" end="01:17.760">getting </span><span begin="01:17.760" end="01:18.600">too </span><span begin="01:18.600" end="01:20.040">close</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.670" end="01:24.480"><span begin="01:20.670" end="01:21.120">You </span><span begin="01:21.120" end="01:21.900">say </span><span begin="01:21.900" end="01:22.440">you </span><span begin="01:22.440" end="01:22.920">love </span><span begin="01:22.920" end="01:23.280">me </span><span begin="01:23.280" end="01:24.480">most</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.570" end="01:29.010"><span begin="01:24.570" end="01:24.900">It's </span><span begin="01:24.900" end="01:25.410">hard </span><span begin="01:25.410" end="01:25.890">to </span><span begin="01:25.890" end="01:26.430">trust </span><span begin="01:26.430" end="01:26.700">it </span><span begin="01:26.700" end="01:27.210">even </span><span begin="01:27.210" end="01:27.570">though </span><span begin="01:27.570" end="01:27.750">I </span><span begin="01:27.750" end="01:28.050">want </span><span begin="01:28.050" end="01:29.010">to</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.250" end="01:31.470"><span begin="01:29.250" end="01:29.430">Need </span><span begin="01:29.430" end="01:29.520">to </span><span begin="01:29.520" end="01:29.820">get </span><span begin="01:29.820" end="01:30.030">this </span><span begin="01:30.030" end="01:30.450">shit </span><span begin="01:30.450" end="01:30.750">out </span><span begin="01:30.750" end="01:30.870">of </span><span begin="01:30.870" end="01:31.170">my </span><span begin="01:31.170" end="01:31.470">head</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.470" end="01:34.590"><span begin="01:31.470" end="01:31.800">Before </span><span begin="01:31.800" end="01:31.890">I </span><span begin="01:31.890" end="01:32.190">flip </span><span begin="01:32.190" end="01:32.550">this </span><span begin="01:32.550" end="01:32.760">on </span><span begin="01:32.760" end="01:33.360">myself </span><span begin="01:33.360" end="01:34.590">instead</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.510" end="01:38.490"><span begin="01:36.510" end="01:37.050">Please </span><span begin="01:37.050" end="01:37.260">come </span><span begin="01:37.260" end="01:37.770">over </span><span begin="01:37.770" end="01:38.490">here</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.640" end="01:39.990"><span begin="0